From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mergimg0 <256672396+mergimg0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 23:27:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] feat(core): register the harness distribution

Coding Harness ships its engine in .harness-aidlc (the user's .harness/
holds harness configuration). Teach runtime discovery, hook path
resolution, statusline and integrity roots, settings, the doctor and the
scan/doc exclusions about that directory and the harness distribution name.
